# Chain-shape assertions: <finding-id-prefix> <min-hops> <ordered,hop,actions> [primary|alternate]
#
# The fourth column selects escalation_path (primary, the default when omitted) or
# alternate_escalation_path (alternate). Every assertion below predates the alternate
# column and omits it, so all of them keep reading against the primary path unchanged.
#
# The *.ruleset goldens prove WHICH rules fire; these prove the graph still produces
# real multi-hop chains. Without them a regression that flattened every path to a
# single hop would pass every other gate in this script.
#
# The action list must appear as an ordered subsequence of the finding's hops, so
# inserting a new intermediate hop does not spuriously fail the gate.
#
# The tenant holds no dangerous verb of its own. It reaches cluster-admin only by
# steering the Flux controller, so this asserts the confused-deputy bridge exists
# and is genuinely the first hop.
#
# The prefix names the target (:cluster_admin_equivalent) because deepchain-deployer
# steers the same controller to four separate sinks (Task 11): one finding per sink,
# all sharing this RuleID and Subject. An unqualified prefix now matches all four,
# which trips the exactly-one-match check above rather than picking one silently.
KUBE-CONFUSED-DEPUTY-001:ServiceAccount/deepchain-tenant/deepchain-deployer:cluster_admin_equivalent 2 operator_reconcile
#
# The same confused-deputy bridge also reaches node_escape and system_masters
# through the controller. Before Task 11 these three chains were silently dropped
# by dedupe (only the cluster-admin finding above survived); pinning them here
# keeps that data loss from regressing invisibly.
KUBE-CONFUSED-DEPUTY-001:ServiceAccount/deepchain-tenant/deepchain-deployer:node_escape 2 operator_reconcile,node_drain_migrate
KUBE-CONFUSED-DEPUTY-001:ServiceAccount/deepchain-tenant/deepchain-deployer:system_masters 3 operator_reconcile,node_drain_migrate,control_plane_pki_theft
#
# Namespace-admin must be walked past into the co-located cluster-admin-bound SA.
KUBE-PRIVESC-PATH-CLUSTER-ADMIN:ServiceAccount/deepchain-tenant/deepchain-binder 3 modify_role_binding,colocated_sa_token_theft
